          Ask me anything — I'm here to help with writing, analysis, questions, and more.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Button
        variant="outline"
        size="lg"
        className="w-full max-w-xs"
      >
        <MessageSquare className="mr-2 h-4 w-4" />
        Start chatting
      </Button>
